                "message": "✨ Add see-also notes and endnotes told by footnote label\n\nsp-note-kinds defines the label convention (see-N, end-N), the commands\nthat insert a note, the renumbering in text order and the endnotes\ntemplate. sp-see-also reads see-N notes (legacy footnotes still count) and\nconverts old ones; Org's footnote normalize and sp-org-lint-footnotes leave\nthe notes alone. Keys C-; n a/e/E/r/M.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAHsMuLG5iLMWeAjmt",
